    {
      "q": "Round or square tower: which should I choose?",
      "a": "Both use the same evaporative principle and capacity range. Square towers suit tight plots, rooftops and installations against walls; round towers use a rotary sprinkler instead of spray nozzles."
    },
    {
      "q": "What outlet water temperature can I expect?",
      "a": "Outlet water is rated at wet bulb temperature + 4 °C."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which fill should I choose?",
      "a": "L fills for inlet water up to 55 °C, H fills for 55–85 °C, and polypropylene rings (P) for hot or dirty water."
